Provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

packages/core carries, verbatim, the twelve TypeScript modules and their tests
from the WP0 merge-forensics instrument developed in the "semantic-merge"
research program by the same author. scripts/verify-carried.sh enforces that
they remain unmodified. The behavioural specification for those modules is
docs/adr/02-wp0-measurement.md and the claim boundary they stay inside is
docs/adr/00-scope-and-verdict.md.

The method those modules serve was established empirically in the
"projects-mrgr" fork-composition study by the same author.

