Third-party programs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Required now:

  git         GPL-2.0-only        >= 2.38.0, enforced at runtime

Planned, NOT yet implemented or invoked by any code in this tree:

  mergiraf    GPL-3.0-only        optional merge mechanism
  diff3       GPL-3.0-or-later    optional merge mechanism (GNU diffutils)

When those mechanisms are implemented, they will be invoked only as external
processes over a documented file-and-exit-code contract. This project does not
link against them, vendor them, bundle them, or fetch them at install time, and
no license of theirs extends to this work on that basis alone. A subprocess
boundary is a design decision, not a legal opinion; the packed artifact is the
fact that matters and it is audited before any release.
